      "shapes": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bullets": [
            "Oracle D&A All Hands | July 2025",
            "4",
            "D&A Strategy",
            "Strategy alignment will be finalized in the beginning of August and articulated during our next quarterly all hands call",
            "After reviewing our Vision & Strategy set in FY25…",
            "… We will enhance our visions and expand our offerings in FY26",
            "Better",
            "Deeper",
            "Wider",
            "Cooler",
            "Bigger",
            "Smarter",
            "Stronger",
            "Continuous Improvement",
            "Data Coverage",
            "Industry Breadth",
            "Digital & AI / GenAI",
            "Capability Extend",
            "Operation at Scale",
            "People Experience",
            "Continue our Finance for FS and industrialize our delivery",
            "Expand our data coverage to focus on master and reference data, SCM & L2R collaborations for customer, supplier, and product",
            "Expand our offerings to Healthcare, TMT, Energy, and Consumer Goods industry",
            "Embed AI / GenAI use cases across full Oracle stack, tapping into firm’s broader AI strategy and investments",
            "Integrate data governance more judiciously",
            "Increase our operational excellence and transparency",
            "Grow the team, improve connectivity and collaboration , and execute My+",
            "We continue to work on finance transformation projects for FS",
            "We made significant strides in master and reference data and collaborated more with SCM & L2R",
            "We continue to expand into Healthcare, TMT, Energy, Consumer Goods, and Manufacturing industries",
            "We are driving the Oracle Practice's innovation and AI initiatives",
            "We started to bring data governance into our transformation work and will continue to do so",
            "We published ePro and delivery maps for all our sub-capabilities and are involved in delivery excellence and PDM initiatives",
            "We have been connecting with our teams and collaborating with each other, though not as regularly as prior year",
            "AI Influenced Solutions",
            "Data Analysis + Science",
            "Data Translation"
          ]
        },
