            "Beau Jenkins",
            "Fun Fact: I’ve been into competitive ballroom dance for two years.",
            "I got my start at Emporia State with a degree in Computer Information Systems. I’ve worked in a range of industries – but what’s stuck with me most is how powerful good data can be when the right people are behind it. That’s a big part of why I joined PwC—to work with people who care about doing things the right way.",
