            "Fun Fact: I’m a member of the Notre Dame Marching Band, the oldest college band in the country.",
            "I am a rising senior at the University of Notre Dame in South Bend, IN - but I am from Staten Island, NY and am happy to be home this summer. I intend to graduate with a BBA in Business Analytics next May. I look forward to working alongside the brilliant PwC team this summer!",
