            "Team brainstorm ideas + methods!",
            "D&A Trivia – the game Swapnil created months ago that never got played",
            "Virtual Pictionary – breakout rooms hosted by comms team members who have a list of words (could be themed for summer, D&A related, etc.). Each breakout room would be split into 2 teams, and they would play against each other for who is the fastest at guessing the drawing. Each team would have a collaborative pptx slide that one person shares on the screen (team captain) so everyone can see the drawings live. Winners from each breakout room get a prize.",
